{"assets":["/statement-assets/230e845131780a5c07342c8c668eee90ae2ad78eaac6df643e1a4cccc93933aa.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1290","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Irreducible Anagrams"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call two strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"anagrams"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of each other if it is possible to rearrange symbols in the string $$$s$$$ to get a string, equal to $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's consider two strings $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"which are anagrams of each other"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". We say that $$$t$$$ is a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"reducible anagram"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$s$$$ if there exists an integer $$$k \\ge 2$$$ and $$$2k$$$ non-empty strings $$$s_1, t_1, s_2, t_2, \\dots, s_k, t_k$$$ that satisfy the following conditions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If we write the strings $$$s_1, s_2, \\dots, s_k$$$ in order, the resulting string will be equal to $$$s$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" If we write the strings $$$t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_k$$$ in order, the resulting string will be equal to $$$t$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For all integers $$$i$$$ between $$$1$$$ and $$$k$$$ inclusive, $$$s_i$$$ and $$$t_i$$$ are anagrams of each other. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If such strings don't exist, then $$$t$$$ is said to be an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"irreducible anagram"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of $$$s$$$. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that these notions are only defined when $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ are anagrams of each other"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, consider the string $$$s = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gamegame"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". Then the string $$$t = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"megamage"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is a reducible anagram of $$$s$$$, we may choose for example $$$s_1 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"game"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$s_2 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"gam"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$s_3 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"e"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and $$$t_1 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mega"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$t_2 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mag"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$t_3 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"e"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\":"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/230e845131780a5c07342c8c668eee90ae2ad78eaac6df643e1a4cccc93933aa.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"On the other hand, we can prove that $$$t = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memegaga"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" is an irreducible anagram of $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You will be given a string $$$s$$$ and $$$q$$$ queries, represented by two integers $$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le |s|$$$ (where $$$|s|$$$ is equal to the length of the string $$$s$$$). For each query, you should find if the substring of $$$s$$$ formed by characters from the $$$l$$$-th to the $$$r$$$-th has "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" irreducible anagram."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a string $$$s$$$, consisting of lowercase English characters ($$$1 \\le |s| \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a single integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 10^5$$$)  — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the following $$$q$$$ lines contain two integers $$$l$$$ and $$$r$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le |s|$$$), representing a query for the substring of $$$s$$$ formed by characters from the $$$l$$$-th to the $$$r$$$-th."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, print a single line containing \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) if the corresponding substring has at least one irreducible anagram, and a single line containing \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes) otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\naaaaa\n3\n1 1\n2 4\n5 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYes\nNo\nYes\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\naabbbbbbc\n6\n1 2\n2 4\n2 2\n1 9\n5 7\n3 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNo\nYes\nYes\nYes\nNo\nNo\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, in the first and third queries, the substring is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", which has itself as an irreducible anagram since two or more non-empty strings cannot be put together to obtain \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". On the other hand, in the second query, the substring is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aaa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", which has no irreducible anagrams: its only anagram is itself, and we may choose $$$s_1 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$s_2 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$t_1 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$t_2 = $$$ \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to show that it is a reducible anagram."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second query of the second sample, the substring is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", which has, for example, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as an irreducible anagram."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1290B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1290/problem/B"}